nodecode-rtk is a rewrite of kerrz2020's kerrz2020/hermes-rtk-rewrite:
https://github.com/kerrz2020/hermes-rtk-rewrite
commit 4c5f8a5abdfd7980cba5ef02df86b8efe52c00d6
